\end{schema}

\texttt{VerifyInboundResult} is the shape the \texttt{verify\_signature}
MCP tool actually returns (trust level, validity, key ID, signer ---
see \S~MCP Tool Surface); the seven-step Verify Flow above computes
it, but is not itself formalised step by step, in keeping with this
document's level of abstraction: the schemas here fix the
\emph{decision logic} (what a given verification outcome means), not
the byte-level GPG plumbing that produces it.

